&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketing Associate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary of Posit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In a B2B SaaS environment, we are seeking a motivated, detail-oriented, and execution-focused Marketing Associate (on a Contract basis) to support and execute our organic content engine. In this role, you will assist with social media creation and distribution, blog creation, and YouTube production, helping translate complex technical product concepts into engaging, clear, and high-performing content that drives top-of-funnel reach and brand awareness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work hands-on across editorial pipelines, video creation, and multi-channel asset distribution to engage B2B buyers across the customer journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Editorial &amp;amp; Content Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
