&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Calendar Maintenance:&lt;/strong&gt; Own and maintain the integrated content calendar across blog, YouTube, and key social channels (LinkedIn) to ensure on-time publication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Newsletter: &lt;/strong&gt;Draft and assist in creation of specific newsletters in LinkedIn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YouTube &amp;amp; Video Production&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
